","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pvWqL63g5ao3SePcWeZ0q4VBFRR.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 2","episodeNumber":2,"sourceEpisodeNumber":2,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"19181","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"187062","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"mal","id":"61084","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"284969","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"460693","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[2]}],"link":"103751","synopsis":"Matsunaga goes in search of a new firefighting crew.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/beUQ9ocCoyOXCGUV0wIW7Ct8KF9.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 3","episodeNumber":3,"sourceEpisodeNumber":3,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"19181","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"187062","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"mal","id":"61084","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"284969","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"460693","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]}],"link":"103965","synopsis":"Gengo goes to recruit a flag bearer, and finds a man in serious debt trouble.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wabW5mlNf9p9GpNAdcrWHc4QueP.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 4","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"19181","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"187062","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"61084","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"284969","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"460693","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"104048","synopsis":"Gengo goes in search of an old friend, and meets his son.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pKu39ij02oL6YX6LcYcz1sc4v5O.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 5","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"19181","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"187062","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"61084","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"284969","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"460693","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"104635","synopsis":"強風吹き荒れる夜、蕎麦屋・小諸屋で謎の爆発火災が発生。源吾たちは現場へ急行するが、店内には動かせぬ病の女将と彼女を見守るお鈴の姿があった。風向きの変化と再びの爆発の危険が迫り、森羅万象に通じ、火の動きを読む“風読み”が必要だった。源吾は星十郎を迎えに走る。星十郎は葛藤を乗り越え、命を救うために小諸屋へ。燃え盛る炎の中で、命の重みと絆が交錯する熱き救出劇がはじまる。\"","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5b410nq9YV7ICpU1EJhmXDvrLd0.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 6","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"19181","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"187062","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"61084","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"284969","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"460693","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"105327","synopsis":"空気が乾き、北風吹きすさぶ江戸の冬、大火が四ツ谷の町を襲う！“ぼろ鳶組”の前に立ちはだかるのは、江戸一番の人気と実力を兼ね備える火消組、“加賀鳶”。「寺社を守るのが我らの誇り」「命を守るのが、火消の本分だ！」激突する二つの信念。燃える紙問屋へと飛び込んだ源吾に、心の傷となった火への恐怖が再び襲いかかる！\n\n転がる“鐘”が運命を変える。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/iX47FK4x2tQA5ZthTAvREsjBMFs.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 7","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"19181","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"187062","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"61084","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"284969","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"460693","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"105574","synopsis":"“ぼろ鳶組”は、被災した小諸屋の復旧を手伝う。その帰り道、源吾と妻・深雪は七年前の“あの日”を思い出す。当時、飯田町定火消の頭だった源吾は、仲間と溝ができていた。そんな中、深雪の父・右膳の屋敷が火事に！助けに向かった源吾だが、仲間たちがとった行動で窮地に立たされる。この火事こそが、源吾が火消を辞めるきっかけだったのだ。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wbNta8F7USPHGY580TUHWJYYkxU.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 8","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"19181","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"187062","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"61084","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"284969","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"460693","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"105807","synopsis":"江戸の町で、青白い炎を上げる謎の火事が連続して発生。源吾たちは現場に残された“狐”の印から、正体不明の放火魔“狐火”の存在を知る。星十郎は放火の手法を、燃える風・瓦斯によるものと見抜くものの、裏では“狐火”が不気味に笑い、さらに凶悪な陰謀を進めていた！","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/y3JmH5rF9hP8J2cQjEyvxYANQUq.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 9","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"19181","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"187062","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"61084","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"284969","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"460693","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]}],"link":"105907","synopsis":"“狐火”と呼ばれる放火魔の正体が、かつての天才花火師『秀助』であることが判明する。秀助には、とある花火の実験で事故が起こり、妻子の命を奪われるという悲惨な過去が……。秀助は心を壊し、火消や世間を憎んでいた。復讐に囚われて炎を操る秀助は、江戸すべてを焼き尽くす大火を仕掛けようとしていた！一方、火付盗賊改方の長官・長谷川平蔵とともに、源吾たちぼろ鳶組は“狐火”を待ち構えるが、秀助の張った罠により火の手は瞬く間に広がる！","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/z5sJpqJAQtRo4HLr6E2nX2f5r1v.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 10","episodeNumber":10,"sourceEpisodeNumber":10,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"19181","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"187062","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"mal","id":"61084","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"284969","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"460693","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]}],"link":"106006","synopsis":"新之助が、父・蔵之介の墓参りの後に目黒の火事に遭遇。巨大な炎の奔流、“朱土竜”が仕掛けられた土蔵を発見する。源吾の「命を守ることが本分」という教えを胸に犬を助けようとするが、爆発に巻き込まれてしまう。絶望の淵にいた源吾だったが、この事件と左門の魂の叫びで復活し、燃え盛る江戸の街へと再び向かっていく。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lmjQH3AUFeEaBnW2Olzx2HluPCQ.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 11","episodeNumber":11,"sourceEpisodeNumber":11,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"19181","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"187062","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"mal","id":"61084","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"284969","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"460693","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[11]}],"link":"106168","synopsis":"江戸を焼き尽くす炎が永代橋を呑み込む。爆破された橋、崩れゆく避難路。源吾と仲間たちは命懸けで人々を救い出す。一方、深雪は母を探す少女お七と出会い、混乱の中で新之助の生存を知る。しかし、“狐火”の陰謀はまだ終わらない。燃え盛る深川、逃げ場を失った民衆。炎と涙が交錯する“明和の大火”が発生し、命を懸けた火消たちの闘いがはじまる！","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/uTLA4alOAsoJ7e0UQrRmFhLaYuW.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 12","episodeNumber":12,"sourceEpisodeNumber":12,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"19181","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"187062","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"mal","id":"61084","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"284969","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"460693","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[12]}],"link":"106283","synopsis":"江戸の空を焦がした大火。命を賭して火を制した火消たちの闘いは、まだ終わらない。復讐に囚われた“狐火”秀助と、憎しみを鎮めようとする源吾。交わる二つの炎が、ついに運命の夜を迎える。消せるのは、火か。それとも心の炎か","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7xHMDBZd26V9dNf9lix1v0UbvtS.jpg"}],"sourceIds":{"anilistId":187062,"malId":61084},"mappings":{"source":"anibridge-v3","schemaVersion":"3.0.3","generatedOn":"2026-10-29T07:54:59Z","sourceDescriptors":["anilist:187062